# Direct dependencies with loose (~=) pins: patch releases are allowed, but only when the
# lock is regenerated deliberately. requirements.txt is the compiled lock that Docker installs.
#
#   just deps-compile                            regenerate both locks
#   just deps-compile --upgrade                  bump everything within the ~= ranges
#   just deps-compile --upgrade-package fastapi  bump a single dependency
